<title>USA: FGIC qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Rockford, Ill., $13.2 million of general obligation refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Novi, Mich., $11.2 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--East Penn SD, Pa., $12.5 million GO bonds under alternate bidding.</p>
<p>--East Stroudsburg SD, Pa., $9.9 million of GO bonds under alternate bidding.</p>
<p>--Great Falls HSD, Mont., $5 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
